1.ssh-keygen Generate SSH key pair
2.ssh-add <key> Add SSH key to SSH agent
3.ssh-add -l List SSH keys in SSH agent
4.ssh-copy-id <user>@<host> Copy SSH key to <host> for
<user>
5.ssh <host> Connect to <host> as current
user
6.ssh <user>@<host> Connect to <host> as <user>
7.scp <src> <host>:<dest> Copy local file <src> to <dest>
on <host>
8.scp <host>:<src> <dest> Copy file <src> from <host> to
local <dest>
